OL,3,GNEWSALong-lost station sign features in
OL,4,Aheritage festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic railway sign which was
OL,7,Fspotted up for sale by chance in an
OL,8,Fonline auction will now feature in a
OL,9,Ftown heritage event.
OL,11,FThe big red sign once marked
OL,12,FSwadlincote railway station, in
OL,13,FDerbyshire, but it had not been seen
OL,14,Ffor more than 60 years after the
OL,15,Fstation's closure.
OL,17,FIt is now on public display at Sharpe's
OL,18,FPottery Museum as part of Swad Heritage
OL,19,FFest 2026, after being donated by the
OL,20,Ffamily who originally intended to sell
OL,21,Fit on Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
