OL,3,GNEWSALong-lost station sign features in
OL,4,Aheritage festival
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Swadlincote isn't a massively old
OL,7,Ftown, it doesn't go back to the Tudor
OL,8,Ftimes, so a lot of our heritage is very
OL,9,Findustrial," said Richard Haywood,
OL,10,Ftrustee at Sharpe's.
